name: sim.getDecimatedMesh
description: Deprecated. Use the simOpenMesh API instead
luaSynopsis: list verticesOut, list indicesOut = sim.getDecimatedMesh(list verticesIn, list indicesIn, float decimationPercentage)
pythonSynopsis: float[] verticesOut, int[] indicesOut = sim.getDecimatedMesh(float[] verticesIn, int[] indicesIn, float decimationPercentage)
inputs:
1. verticesIn: array containing the input vertices (succession of x/y/z values).
2. indicesIn: array containing the input indices (3 values for each triangle).
3. decimationPercentage: percentage of the desired decimation (0.1 - 0.9).
outputs:
1. verticesOut: array containing the output vertices (succession of x/y/z values).
2. indicesOut: array containing the output indices (3 values for each triangle).
